==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|frm|harassement}}; synchronically analyzable as {{af|en|harass|-ment}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/həˈɹæsmənt/|/ˈhæɹəsmənt/}}
